      "result": "condapi当前全量pi05_yam；旧mode/05示例有LoRA残留。14D形状一致不证明单位、夹爪方向、action_dt或norm一致。",
      "classification": "integration-gate"
    },
    {
      "topic": "实际服务入口",
      "result": "YAM PlainPolicyClient已使用msgpack-numpy/WebSocket单在途语义，probe只核形状/finite。condapi serve_policy按checkpoint创建policy，无选择W TensorRT engine的CLI参数；W离线证据不证明该服务已经承载W。",
      "classification": "code-inspection"
    },
    {
      "topic": "模型就绪",
      "result": "用户报告Thor已准备；condapi有基础模型W历史离线结果。本次未取得指定微调checkpoint的服务或RK联调实测。",
      "classification": "historical-evidence-not-current-runtime"
